            "title": "Length 1",
            "id": 59910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo l'istruzione <code>len()</code> con il nome della lista tra parentesi per ottenere il numero di elementi in una lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(len(users))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>len</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Printing",
            "id": 59914,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>print()</code> per visualizzare la lunghezza di una lista nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(len(users))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>print()</code> per visualizzare la lunghezza di una lista nella console.</p><p>Mostra quanti utenti sono presenti nella lista affinché la console visualizzi <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(len(users))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;users&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>len</code> e infine <code>users</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
