            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se usiamo <code>len()</code> su una lista vuota, restituirà <code>0</code>. Possiamo vederlo qui quando visualizziamo la variabile <code>number_of_users</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number_of_users = len(users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(number_of_users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>number_of_users</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se usiamo <code>len()</code> su una lista vuota, restituirà <code>0</code>.</p><p>Mostra nella console il numero di utenti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number_of_users = len(users)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(number_of_users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"len\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>number_of_users</code>.</p></body></html>",
