            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'istruzione <code>len()</code> richiede un valore di tipo lista tra parentesi.</p><p>Quale sostituzione di <code>result = len()</code> fa visualizzare al codice <code>1</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"result = len()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>result = len(signups)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>result = len(\"signups\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>result = signups.len()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>result = len(signups)</code>.</p></body></html>",
